  "subject": "At four siblings' monthly mahjong night round Big Sister's Sha Tin dining table, played for who buys the milk tea, she takes five minutes over every discard while the others doze, until she finally throws a five-dot and all three win on it at once.",
  "caption": "Cantonese New Orleans second-line brass band, street-parade strut. Sousaphone pumping a bouncing bass line, marching snare with rolling press rolls, separate bass drum and cymbal, trumpet and trombone trading short riffs and three-note stabs, tenor saxophone answering the vocal, tambourine on the backbeat. Live street-parade brass band in a warm room, brass forward, dry punchy drums. Female alto, brassy and teasing, belted full chest voice, clearly sung melody on every line. Clear full voice, every word enunciated, steady sung melody on every line. 104 BPM, Bb major. Impatient, cheeky, affectionate strut. No trap drums, no autotune, no rap, no synth pads, no EDM drops, no slow ballad sections.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n月尾四姊弟 齊齊打麻雀\n沙田大家姐屋企 張枱最大\n賭注係一杯凍奶茶\n輸家就要落樓去買\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n大家姐摸起一隻牌\n睇完天花又望地下\n\n[Chorus]\n大家姐 你出隻牌啦\n我哋三個都瞌眼瞓\n五筒一出 三家食糊\n一炮三響 你去買茶\n\n[Verse]\n五分鐘過咗 佢仲未出\n我撐住頭 閉咗隻眼\n細佬瞓到流晒口水\n阿妹發夢都喺度摸牌\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n佢又嘆口氣 搖吓頭\n拎起隻牌 又放低\n\n[Chorus]\n大家姐 你出隻牌啦\n我哋三個瞓咗一轉\n五筒一出 三家食糊\n一炮三響 你去買茶\n\n[Verse]\n終於佢手指一鬆\n啪一聲 一隻五筒\n我同細佬同阿妹\n三副牌 一齊攤開\n\n[Bridge]\n大家姐 面都青晒\n隔離枱阿嬸都拍手\n細佬話 我要加冰\n\n[Chorus]\n大家姐 你終於出牌\n我哋三個醒晒神\n五筒一出 三家食糊\n一炮三響 你買三杯\n\n[Outro]\n一炮三響 三杯奶茶\n大家姐 我要少甜",
